+
+### XGrammar temperature
+
+XGrammar processor factories accept a positive, finite `temperature`. Logits
+are divided by this value before grammar constraints are applied. The default
+is `1.0`, which preserves the unscaled behavior. The configured temperature
+survives `reset()`; reset only clears per-generation processor state.
